Rutland County","/arc-plc/vermont/rutland-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 49% of normal for July to August and 53% for August to September. Grid 28129 had its driest year in 1965, at 73% of normal.</p>"}
